A program analysis tool for verifying compliance with laws and policies

Usage: vampiro [COMMAND]

Commands:
  check    Analyze source files for composition, modularity, and robustness breaks
  init-ci  Generate CI workflow configuration
  prove    Reserved for proof commands
  doctor   Run diagnostic checks on the project
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
